      "widgets_values": [
        "DEMO: Ask Qwen for a bounded palette decision. A situation plus question and two allowed labels become a selected label and distribution. Unlike the supplied-score exercise, the model produces these scores. Keep labels unchanged; edit the situation to compare answers.\n\n1. Download Qwen 0.6B with ↓ if missing.\n2. Press the top Run button (or ▷ on the inference node). Follow the wires to the result. ϟ only previews locally on the inference node; it does not update connected nodes.\n3. Change the scene in prompt and compare the scores.\nThe model picks only a listed option. Scores are uncalibrated and the choice may be poor. No generated code runs.\n\nNodes in this demo:\nꘅ Local Decision · 1 · describe a scene\nꘅ Text / JSON Viewer · 2 · selected palette\nꘅ Text / JSON Viewer · 3 · scores and distribution"
      ]
    },
